{"event": "LOG_INITIALIZED", "reason": "no_events_yet", "timestamp": 1783913553.523273, "app_version": "3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3"}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "皆さん、こんにちは。株式会社", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913583.2674007}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "サクラサクラプラス代表の中山です。本日は", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913586.7914057}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "二千二六年七月期第三四半期決算についてご案内申し上げます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913590.1041088}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ます。まずは二千二十六年七月期第三四半期", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913594.758944}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "決算概要についてお知らせいたします。売上高につい", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913599.065848}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ては百三十六億七千九百万となり", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913602.9166782}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "前年同期比五点四パーセントの減収となりま", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913605.936002}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。これは既存園の在籍率向上や", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913609.7139974}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "工程価格の上昇による補助金増額", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913613.6635385}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "保育所の新規開設や増床が寄与し", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913617.0457613}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "主力の保育サービスにおて増収となりました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913619.293725}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不動産事業は前期に計上した", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913624.2725234}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "大型不動産売却案件の反動により", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913628.1643474}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "当期も不動産売却は実施したものの", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913631.1762269}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "全体としては厳粛となりました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913631.8374534}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "なお、その他サービスは概ね計画どり進捗しております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913636.5234947}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "営業利益は十億六千百万円となり、前年同期比", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913641.4788659}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "一点五パーセントの原因となりました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913643.3540661}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不採算事業の撤退や中核事業の合理化", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913648.3537648}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "業務効率化により営業利益率は七点五パーセントから七点", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913652.4266984}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "点に向上しまた", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913653.8290043}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。経常利益は十一億二千八百万円と", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913658.8200984}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "なり、前年同期比9。5の増益となりました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913661.0331779}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "保育所の新規開設や蔵書の実施により", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913666.0483134}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "これらに伴う開演前の補助金収入が加算されたことにより増益となり", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913669.2525947}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ます。親会社株主に属する当期純利", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913673.1014771}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "前期に計上した不採算事業の撤退に伴う特別損失がなくなった", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913684.3675568}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "、早期は増益となります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913686.699075}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "続いて進捗率についてお知らせいたします。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913690.1831934}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "売上高は通期予算に対して", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913692.8544345}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "各サービスとも堅調に成長しており", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913699.3574455}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "投資四半期累計機関におて順調に推移しておます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913703.56102}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "営業利益は通期予算に対し", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913705.3401752}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "対応のない成果や", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913710.3869457}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不採算事業の定義といった毎期継続している費用削減の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913714.5270207}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "比較が確実に低下を送信", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913716.4604092}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "収益が概ね予算通りに推移する中", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913721.4182842}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "これらの施策が利益の上振れを牽引し", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913724.623398}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "当四半期累計期間において通期予算を前倒して", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913727.6449542}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "達成しました続いて", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913732.51926}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "貸借対照表です。資産の分は販売に伴う販売用不動産の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913736.192008}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "減少があった一方、補助金収入による", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913741.3096154}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "未収入金の増加、不動産取得", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913744.7628164}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "保育施設の新設増床による", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913745.4757984}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "資産合計は二十八億", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913750.4526017}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "七千百万円増加しました負債の部は", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913754.656682}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "主に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913754.6894727}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "蔵書に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913757.5216577}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "禁忌不動産", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913758.8864465}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "産", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913761.3505123}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "負債合計は二十一億三千三百万円", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913765.6774483}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "らの結果、自己資本比率は四十三点九", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913770.6336951}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "から40。7に低下いたしました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913775.6806993}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "続いて二千二十六年七月に軽トピックスをお知らせいたし", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913778.9695861}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。保育サービスにおいては大阪市中国で桜咲く未来東平を", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913783.7465622}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "予定通り解説しており", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913785.0314078}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "桜咲く未来晴海におても予定通り増床を行い", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913789.2912583}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "自動定員数が増加しまた。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913791.5169141}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "他人口増加で保育所が不足しいる晴海エリアから月島エリア", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913796.5312467}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "、親子で乗れる送迎バスの運行も開始しております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913800.7158656}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "2027年7月期では", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913805.6954882}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "東京都中国にて一施設の新規保育所の開設を予定しております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913808.5834312}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "フェムケアフェムテックサービスにおいては、連結子会社のイェールにて", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913813.590298}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "2026年夏頃に新製品の発売を予定しておます", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913818.0881324}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "この新製品の発売によ量産サプリメント市場で", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913823.039619}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "さらなるレアの格納", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913824.6746783}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "続いて覚悟会社の取締役の収入", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913829.671971}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "についてお知らせいたします。連結子会社の桜咲く未来", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913833.6196811}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "石川祐介氏が取締役へ就任しました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913837.9427838}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "なお石川氏は佐倉作プラス経営管理本部長も兼任しております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913841.389025}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "石川市の就任により桜咲く未来およびグループ全体の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913846.0295384}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.3-20260713-123233-2f1ed00b", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "財務戦略およびガバナンス体制をより強固に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783913850.1414254}
